178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (UKM Thrift is a mobile app designed for Universiti Kebangsaan Malaysia \(UKM\) students and staff to buy, sell, and donate preloved items like clothes, shoes, and books, fostering sustainability and community welfare. The platform offers features such as secure inventory management using Room Database, a donation system with scheduled drop-offs powered by Firebase Firestore, and a seamless purchase experience with flexible payment options, including cash and RHB student cards. By enabling the reuse of items and promoting a circular economy, UKM Thrift reduces waste and supports a socially responsible campus culture.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
